# V-1/PT-03 evidence: `scroll` must genuinely move the ScrollPosition, not
# fake a gesture. 18 quick-adds overflow one screen of History's ListView;
# screenshots before/after `scroll down` show whether new content is
# actually revealed.

before each test
  restart the app
  wait until "Quick Add" appears

test "scroll down reveals more history entries than are visible at rest"
  repeat 18 times
    tap #today_quick_add_250
    wait 1 seconds
  tap #nav_tab_history
  wait until "History" appears
  take a screenshot called "v1_history_before_scroll"
  scroll down
  wait 1 seconds
  take a screenshot called "v1_history_after_scroll"
